{"issue": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/816", "repository_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK", "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/816/labels{/name}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/816/comments", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/816/events", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/816", "id": 472814311, "node_id": "MDU6SXNzdWU0NzI4MTQzMTE=", "number": 816, "title": "Move protoc generation out of cmake and version generated files", "user": {"login": "JonasVautherin", "id": 2606672, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjI2MDY2NzI=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2606672?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin", "html_url": "https://github.com/JonasVautherin", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "labels": [], "state": "closed", "locked": false, "assignees": [], "milestone": null, "comments": 1, "created_at": "2019-07-25T11:32:37Z", "updated_at": "2019-08-13T11:43:44Z", "closed_at": "2019-08-13T11:43:44Z", "assignee": null, "author_association": "COLLABORATOR", "issue_field_values": [], "type": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "sub_issues_summary": {"total": 0, "completed": 0, "percent_completed": 0}, "issue_dependencies_summary": {"blocked_by": 0, "total_blocked_by": 0, "blocking": 0, "total_blocking": 0}, "body": "@julianoes, @thomasetter: I'd like to have your opinion on that :blush:.\r\n\r\nWe use protobuf + gRPC in `mavsdk_server`, and therefore generate code with the proto compiler (`protoc`), at build time. I believe this should change, mainly for the following reasons:\r\n\r\n* We will soon want to autogenerate more code, using our own protoc plugin. It will make the autogeneration a bit more complex (will require to build a python module, etc), and therefore I don't feel like keeping that in our CMakeLists. We already have separate scripts for that [in Swift](https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK-Swift/blob/master/tools/generate_from_protos.bash) and [in Python](https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK-Python/blob/master/other/tools/run_protoc.sh).\r\n* We will autogenerate the C++ header files, and it would make sense to version them, so that we can link to the github files in discussions. We already do that [in Swift](https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK-Swift/tree/master/Sources/MAVSDK-Swift/Generated) and [in Python](https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK-Python/tree/master/mavsdk/generated).\r\n* When cross-compiling, we currently need to build for the host first, so that we get `protoc`, and then we can cross-compile. It takes time (e.g. on the CI), and sometimes it doesn't work. For instance when using dockcross on my machine, my host-built `protoc` relies on a version of glibc that is not available in the dockcross container, and therefore `protoc` doesn't run there.\r\n\r\nFor those reasons, I believe it makes sense to generate the files separately, and version them.\r\n\r\nThe new workflow would look a bit like this:\r\n\r\n1. If you don't need to generate the files (typically when cross-compiling), you just run `cmake` (configure) and  `cmake --build` (build), and rely on the versioned generated files.\r\n2. If you need to generate the files, you:\r\n\r\n    a. run `cmake` (configure) so that you get `protoc`\r\n    b. run `generate_protos.sh`\r\n    c. run `cmake --build` (build)\r\n\r\n@thomas.etter: Note that this would break the changes you did for automatically re-generating when the proto files change.", "closed_by": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes", "html_url": "https://github.com/julianoes", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/816/reactions", "total_count": 1, "+1": 1, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "timeline_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/816/timeline", "performed_via_github_app": null, "state_reason": "completed", "pinned_comment": null}, "comments": [{"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/515050787", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/816#issuecomment-515050787", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/816", "id": 515050787, "node_id": "MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDUxNTA1MDc4Nw==", "user": {"login": "thomasetter", "id": 422775, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjQyMjc3NQ==", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/422775?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/thomasetter", "html_url": "https://github.com/thomasetter", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/thomasetter/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/thomasetter/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/thomasetter/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/thomasetter/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/thomasetter/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/thomasetter/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/thomasetter/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/thomasetter/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/thomasetter/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2019-07-25T13:48:50Z", "updated_at": "2019-07-25T13:48:50Z", "body": "I have also come to think that checking in the generated files is the way to go.\r\n\r\n> @thomas.etter: Note that this would break the changes you did for automatically re-generating when the proto files change.\r\n\r\nIf we create a CI check which runs the proto-file compilation and makes sure that there are no diffs, we can run it in parallel, get up-to-date generated files, and keep good build latency.\r\n\r\nWe can do this for arbitrarily many code-generation pipelines without significantly increasing the total check latency.", "author_association": "NONE", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/515050787/reactions", "total_count": 1, "+1": 1, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}], "timeline": [{"id": 2509201916, "node_id": "MDE0Ok1